# Forms & Validation

- Prefer `react-hook-form` with `Controller` for field bindings.
- Use `yup` schemas from [utils/schema.ts](mdc:utils/schema.ts); types from [types/form.ts](mdc:types/form.ts).
- Resolve with `yupResolver(schema)` from `@hookform/resolvers/yup`.
- Show field errors under inputs using `ThemedText type="errorMessage"` or `AppInput`'s `errorMessage` prop.
- Inputs should pass `secureTextEntry` for passwords and provide right-eye icon toggles when specified in Figma.
- Keep submit buttons disabled during submission; show loading via `AppButton`'s `isLoading`.
- For navigation after success, use `expo-router` `router.replace()`.
